@startuml Cursor Rules Creation Sequence
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam roundcorner 15
skinparam shadowing false

title Cursor Rules Creation: From Mature Project to Comprehensive Rule Set

' Define main phases with visual styling
rectangle "🏗️ **Mature Project Analysis**" as PHASE1 #E3F2FD {
  participant "Project" as P
  participant "Patterns" as PAT
  participant "Practices" as PRAC
}

rectangle "📝 **Instruction Creation**" as PHASE2 #F3E5F5 {
  participant "Raw Instructions" as RI
  participant "AI Refinement" as AR
}

rectangle "⚙️ **Rule Generation**" as PHASE3 #E8F5E8 {
  participant "Rule Files" as RF
  participant "Categories" as CAT
}

rectangle "📚 **Documentation**" as PHASE4 #FFF3E0 {
  participant "Usage Guide" as UG
  participant "Confluence Docs" as CD
}

rectangle "🔧 **Automation & Control**" as PHASE5 #FCE4EC {
  participant "Setup Scripts" as SS
  participant "Version Control" as VC
}

rectangle "✅ **Integration & Deployment**" as PHASE6 #E0F2F1 {
  participant "Git Repository" as GIT
  participant "Team Ready" as TEAM
}

' Start the flow
P -> PAT: Identify successful patterns
note right of P: Serverless Architecture\nComprehensive Automation\nConfiguration Management\nQuality Practices\nDocumentation Standards

PAT -> PRAC: Document proven practices
PRAC -> RI: Create initial instructions

RI -> AR: AI-powered refinement
note right of AR: Professional language\nClear structure\nComprehensive coverage\nAI-optimized format

AR -> RF: Generate specialized rules
RF -> CAT: Create rule categories
note right of CAT: 9 Specialized Categories\n4,600+ Lines of Rules\nComprehensive Coverage\nBest Practices Codified

CAT -> UG: Generate usage documentation
UG -> CD: Create Confluence package
note right of CD: Main introductory page\nAI-ready instructions\nImplementation summary\nProcess documentation

CD -> SS: Create automation scripts
SS -> VC: Implement version control
note right of VC: Timestamped backups\nChange tracking\nRollback procedures\nHistory management

VC -> GIT: Commit and push changes
GIT -> TEAM: Ready for team adoption

' Add visual enhancements
note over PHASE1, PHASE2: **Phase 1-2: Foundation**\nEstablish the base for rule creation
note over PHASE3, PHASE4: **Phase 3-4: Creation**\nGenerate comprehensive rule system
note over PHASE5, PHASE6: **Phase 5-6: Deployment**\nMake rules available for team use

' Add success metrics
note over TEAM: **Final Results**\n✅ 9 Specialized Rule Files\n✅ 4,600+ Lines of Rules\n✅ Complete Documentation\n✅ Automation Scripts\n✅ Version Control\n✅ Confluence Package\n✅ AI-Ready Instructions

' Add flow styling
PHASE1 -[#2196F3,thick]-> PHASE2
PHASE2 -[#9C27B0,thick]-> PHASE3
PHASE3 -[#4CAF50,thick]-> PHASE4
PHASE4 -[#FF9800,thick]-> PHASE5
PHASE5 -[#E91E63,thick]-> PHASE6

@enduml 